{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":485811,"name":"Velaria","username":"Velaria","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/v/eb8c5e/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-07T22:48:11.893Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-485811-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-485811-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-485811-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-485811-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot 0.44.0 — Windows 10.0.26200 (America/Santiago)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCannot create a new bot: it stays on “Nuevo Bot / Creando…” and never finishes.\u003cbr\u003e\nExisting bots fail with: “El Bot no pudo responder / Algo salió mal al generar la respuesta. Inténtalo de nuevo.”\u003cbr\u003e\nThis happens on a simple “hola” too. Agent Computer screen is still visible.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAlready tried (did not help):\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eReset Grok Bot’s Computer (failed halfway / partial state)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFull reinstall + delete %AppData%\\Grok Bot\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCreating a new bot (stuck on Creando…)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConversation ID: e145bf5c-80e6-4ffd-b86e-b2ac29415cc8\u003cbr\u003e\nTime: 2026-09-07 ~19:27 America/Santiago\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePlease recover/rebuild the Agent Computer on the backend. Do not wipe existing bots/files if possible.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-485811-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-485811-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSteps to Reproduce — clic en esa caja y pega:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOpen Grok Bot 0.44.0 on Windows.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSend “hola” to any existing bot.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eError: El Bot no pudo responder / Algo salió mal al generar la respuesta.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eClick + → Crear nuevo Bot.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe new bot stays on “Nuevo Bot / Creando…” and never finishes.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-485811-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-485811-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe bot should reply to “hola”. Creating a new bot should complete instead of staying on Creando…\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-485811-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-485811-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eScreenshots / Screen Recordings\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/4/9/49b3480c1146d99a501460c33a9f9e682d623b42.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/avYXLMEXsmXeOkWUOON84RjmGIi.png?dl=1\" title=\"11.png\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/4/9/49b3480c1146d99a501460c33a9f9e682d623b42.png\" alt=\"11.png\" data-base62-sha1=\"avYXLMEXsmXeOkWUOON84RjmGIi\" width=\"671\" height=\"500\" data-dominant-color=\"F9F8F8\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003e11.png\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e997×742